        "F3"
      ],
      "plan": "Analyze a hypothetical retrieval failure in a RAG system. Focus on initial inspection steps: chunking, indexing, and query formulation. Explicitly state the hypothetical nature of the scenario. Invite discussion on debugging strategies."
